                                                "sense_id": "72018227-782d-3c45-931f-d156a0cb6526",
                                                "text": "When she touched my hand, what a chill I got\nHer lips are like a volcano that's hot\nI'm proud to say that she's my buttercup.\nI'm in love - I'm all shook up."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1060911-ceed-4de3-9a16-003d322cf10a",
                                                "sense_id": "72018227-782d-3c45-931f-d156a0cb6526",
                                                "text": "Listen, buttercup, you're damned good in bed. They don't come any better, but I'm really not interested in playing second fiddle to your camera or your young lovers."
                                            }
                                        ]
